## 🎮 How to Use

1. **View the Platform**: Open the live link above
2. **Accept Quests**: Click on quest cards to view requirements
3. **Write Responses**: Use the text editor to draft your analysis
4. **Track Progress**: Watch your XP bar fill in real-time
5. **Unlock Achievements**: Complete hidden objectives for bonus rewards
6. **Climb Tiers**: Progress through mastery levels
7. **View Hall of Fame**: See rankings and peer contributions

